{
  "an2.180-184:0.1": "Numbered Discourses 2.180–229 ",
  "an2.180-184:0.2": "The Chapter of Abbreviated Texts Beginning With Anger ",
  "an2.180-184:1.0": "180–184 ",
  "an2.180-184:1.1": "“There are these two things. ",
  "an2.180-184:1.2": "What two? ",
  "an2.180-184:1.3": "Anger and acrimony … disdain and contempt … jealousy and stinginess … deceit and deviousness … lack of conscience and prudence. ",
  "an2.180-184:1.4": "These are the two things.” ",
  "an2.185-189:1.0": "185–189 ",
  "an2.185-189:1.1": "“There are these two things. ",
  "an2.185-189:1.2": "What two? ",
  "an2.185-189:1.3": "Freedom from anger and acrimony … freedom from disdain and contempt … freedom from jealousy and stinginess … freedom from deceit and deviousness … conscience and prudence. ",
  "an2.185-189:1.4": "These are the two things.” ",
  "an2.190-194:1.0": "190–194 ",
  "an2.190-194:1.1": "“Anyone who has two things lives in suffering. ",
  "an2.190-194:1.2": "What two? ",
  "an2.190-194:1.3": "Anger and acrimony … disdain and contempt … jealousy and stinginess … deceit and deviousness … lack of conscience and prudence. ",
  "an2.190-194:1.4": "Anyone who has these two things lives in suffering.” ",
  "an2.195-199:1.0": "195–199 ",
  "an2.195-199:1.1": "“Anyone who has these two things lives happily. ",
  "an2.195-199:1.2": "What two? ",
  "an2.195-199:1.3": "Freedom from anger and acrimony … freedom from disdain and contempt … freedom from jealousy and stinginess … freed